{"c":[{"name":"20261022T131311Z-ed378e2bb230c4e6","text":"DuckDB 1.5.4 without vss on a file with the HNSW index: every INSERT or DELETE on embeddings fails (Cannot bind index, unknown index type HNSW), even a no-match delete; DROP INDEX IF EXISTS in a transaction works. Drop the index before any write. Measured 2026-10-22.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T134653Z-aa09ea6b143ae13d","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: exact semantic search has no orphan guard. write_session commits each statement separately, so an ingest crash can leave orphan embeddings until the next ingest or embed; a top-k search may then be short, never an error.","type":"note"}]}
